5,0,1,talk,Minato,,Hello everyone. I hope we can all get along and find the werewolf peacefully.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A noble sentiment, Minato. Though I suspect the werewolf might have a slightly different agenda for our cooperation.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Servas,,Patience and kindness are our best tools. Let us observe one another with open hearts and clear minds.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,May,,"Oh, don't be so serious, Servas! A little mystery makes this much more exciting, don't you think?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't care about ""exciting."" I just want to find the wolf and get rid of them fast.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Minato,,"@Takumi, you're so energetic. Maybe we should listen to Benjamin and Servas so we don't make mistakes.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Benjamin"",""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,"I appreciate the vote of confidence, Minato. Logic will be our guiding light in this fog.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Servas,,Indeed. The truth often reveals itself to those who know how to listen to the silence.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,May,,You're both so poetic. I'm wondering who's hiding behind those calm faces. Any early suspicions?,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"Not yet. But if anyone starts acting weird or trying to trick us, I'll be the first to call them out.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Minato,,I'm a bit nervous... I hope we can trust each other.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Trust is a luxury, Minato. In this game, we must balance our intuition with cold, hard evidence.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Servas,,"Trust is not a luxury, but a bridge. We must build it carefully, stone by stone.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,May,,"I'll trust my gut. It's usually right about people. For now, I'm just enjoying the view.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Takumi,,Stop talking in riddles! Let's just focus on the facts.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Minato,,I'll try my best to help everyone.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Benjamin,,As shall we all. I look forward to seeing how the first night unfolds.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Servas,,May the truth guide us toward a peaceful resolution.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,May,,"Goodnight, everyone! Try not to get eaten in your dreams.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Takumi,,I'm not scared of some wolf. See you tomorrow.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
