31,1,1,talk,Minato,,Good morning. Did everyone sleep well? I hope no one is missing.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,"A charmingly naive question, Minato. However, I have some rather illuminating news to share with the group.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Servas,,The morning air is fresh. Let us begin our deliberations with a spirit of honesty.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,May,,"Benjamin looks like he's got a secret. Come on, don't keep us in suspense!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"Get to the point, Benjamin. What do you know?","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Minato,,"@Benjamin, do you know something about who the werewolf is?","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"Indeed. I spent my night seeking the truth, and it led me directly to you, Minato. You are the werewolf.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Servas,,"That is a heavy accusation. Minato, do you have anything to say in your defense?","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,May,,"Wow, right out of the gate! Minato, you looked so innocent. Are you really the big bad wolf?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"I knew something felt off! Benjamin, are you the Seer? If you are, then Minato is toast.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin"",""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Minato,,"What? No! I'm not! Benjamin, why would you say that? I just wanted us to be friends...","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Your distress is noted, but the divination is absolute. Logic dictates we act now while we have the numbers.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Servas,,"It is heartbreaking to see such discord so early, but we must prioritize the safety of the village.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,May,,"Minato, your acting is okay, but Benjamin seems way too confident to be lying. I'm leaning toward him.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Minato"",""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Takumi,,I don't care if he's crying. The Seer found him. Let's just vote him out and be done with it.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Minato,,Please believe me... I'm just a villager...,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"A classic plea. Unfortunately, the evidence of my role outweighs the performance of your innocence.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Servas,,"If the Seer has spoken, it is our duty to follow the truth, however painful it may be.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,May,,"Sorry, Minato! You're just too cute to be a wolf, which makes you the perfect suspect.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Takumi,,Enough talking. Let's vote.,"{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
